hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1613","Narrated to us by Al-Jabbar ibn Al-Ala', who said: Narrated to us by Sufyan, who said: Narrated to us by Abu Al-Zinad, on the authority of Al-A'raj, on the authority of Abu Hurairah (RA), who said: ""The Imam is a trustee (Amin), or a leader (Amir). If he prays sitting, then pray sitting; and if he prays standing, then pray standing."""
